---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About Us" description="Learn about our mission and what we're building." showBack={true}>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <img src="/icons/app_icon1.png" alt="" class="badge-icon" />
      About
    </div>
    <h1>About Us</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated: July 2026</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-card">
    <p>
      We are a small, passionate team on a mission to prove that learning to code doesn't have
      to be boring. Coding Shuffle Duel is where <strong style="color: var(--text)">learning meets RPG meets arcade</strong> —
      a gamified experience that makes programming syntax feel less like studying and more like
      leveling up.
    </p>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>
      We believe the best way to learn something is to enjoy doing it. Traditional syntax drills
      are forgettable. Games are not. Our goal is to build experiences that make programming
      concepts stick — not through repetition alone, but through fun, challenge, and the
      satisfaction of getting better.
    </p>
    <p>
      Right now, Coding Shuffle Duel is the perfect entry point for anyone stepping into the
      world of SQL for the first time. But this is just the beginning.
    </p>

    <h2>What We're Building</h2>
    <p>
      Coding Shuffle Duel is our first game, and it's already packed with content:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><img src="/icons/home_icon.png" alt="" class="list-icon" /><strong>Campaign Mode</strong> — handcrafted SQL puzzles from Beginner to Advanced.</li>
      <li><img src="/icons/check_icon.png" alt="" class="list-icon" /><strong>Drag & Drop Gameplay</strong> — reconstruct shuffled code tokens into correct syntax.</li>
      <li><img src="/icons/lightning_icon.png" alt="" class="list-icon" /><strong>Instant Feedback</strong> — know immediately if you're right, and learn why.</li>
      <li><img src="/icons/sql_book_icon.png" alt="" class="list-icon" /><strong>SQL Explanations</strong> — every puzzle comes with a clear breakdown of the concept.</li>
      <li><img src="/icons/star_icon.png" alt="" class="list-icon" /><strong>XP & Progression</strong> — earn stars, level up, and track your best times.</li>
      <li><img src="/icons/chain_icon.png" alt="" class="list-icon" /><strong>Fully Offline</strong> — play anywhere, no internet required.</li>
      <li><img src="/icons/sound_icon.png" alt="" class="list-icon" /><strong>SQL Stream Mode</strong> — a rhythm-inspired arcade mode for rapid keyword recognition.</li>
      <li><img src="/icons/skull_icon.png" alt="" class="list-icon" /><strong>Survival Mode</strong> — one mistake ends your run; how far can you go?</li>
      <li><img src="/icons/calendar_icon.png" alt="" class="list-icon" /><strong>Daily Challenge</strong> — one advanced puzzle per day, same for every player.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What's Coming Next</h2>
    <p>
      We're just getting started. Our roadmap includes expanding beyond SQL into other
      programming languages and technologies — Python, JavaScript, Git, Linux, Docker, and more.
      Each will bring its own game modes, challenges, and learning paths.
    </p>
    <p>
      Longer term, we're building toward multiplayer coding duels, ranked seasons, leaderboards,
      cloud sync, and procedurally generated puzzles — a full platform where developers of all
      levels can learn, compete, and grow.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Values</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><img src="/icons/brain_icon.png" alt="" class="list-icon" /><strong>Learning through play</strong> — gamification isn't a gimmick; it's the whole point.</li>
      <li><img src="/icons/locked_icon.png" alt="" class="list-icon" /><strong>Privacy by design</strong> — offline-first, no tracking, no ads forced on you.</li>
      <li><img src="/icons/clock_icon.png" alt="" class="list-icon" /><strong>Respect for your time</strong> — every feature earns its place; nothing is filler.</li>
      <li><img src="/icons/rune_icon.png" alt="" class="list-icon" /><strong>Ship, listen, improve</strong> — we release, we hear you, we get better.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      Have feedback, ideas, or just want to say hello? We read every message.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:codingshuffleduel@gmail.com">codingshuffleduel@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .badge-icon {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    object-fit: contain;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .list-icon {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    object-fit: contain;
    vertical-align: middle;
    margin-right: 8px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  ul li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
</style>